<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan domestic WPI falls 0.3 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan domestic WPI falls 0.3 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of the overall WPI, was down 0.3 percent in January from a year earlier and down 0.1 percent from December, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the January WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year change (percent)</p>
<p>	    January     December</p>
<p> Overall   +1.0	  +0.9</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.3	  -0.5</p>
<p> Exports   +2.8	  +3.3</p>
<p> Imports  +13.1	 +12.9</p>
<p>Month-on-month change (percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    January     December  Jan Index</p>
<p> Overall   +0.3	  +0.3	 93.7</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.1	  +0.2	 95.2</p>
<p> Exports   +1.3	  +0.5	 87.5</p>
<p> Imports   +3.4	  +1.4	 87.9</p>
</text>
